<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allen Telecom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allen Telecom raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Allen Telecom Inc to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Allen Telecom posted second quarter earnings of $0.25 a share compared with $0.19 a share.</p>
<p>-- Allen Telecom closed Thursday at 20-2/16.</p>
</text>
